        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Linked Art mints la:Set distinct from crm:E78 to allow ad-hoc groupings. Within HG we additionally treat Set as a CuratedHolding for navigation; no semantic collapse — both parents remain.</rdfs:comment>
